# Personal override, not checked in.
#
# Uncomment to run against the real FastAPI backend instead of the MSW mocks. It must
# be listening on 127.0.0.1:8000:
#
#   cd ../backend && uv run uvicorn legal_lens.main:app --reload --port 8000
#
# As of Phase 3 this path is fully functional: matters, conversations, documents and
# chat all work against the real backend. The database starts empty, so upload a
# document before asking anything. The mocks remain the only path with demo content.
#
# VITE_USE_MOCKS=false
